# FDF Mandatory Security Standards

FDF Management stores sensitive personal information including data relating to minors.
Security is non-negotiable. This rule applies to every agent session.

## OWASP Security Procedures

When performing security-sensitive work, use the vendored OWASP procedures:

```
tooling/owasp-security-playbook/code-security-skills/
```

Relevant plays and skills:
- `plays/code-review-security.md` — general code security review
- `plays/api-security-review.md` — API endpoint security
- `plays/secrets-scan.md` — credential/secret detection
- `plays/sca-audit.md` — dependency vulnerability audit
- `plays/owasp-top10-web-review.md` — OWASP Top 10 web review
- `skills/web-security-review/SKILL.md` — web security skill
- `skills/api-security-review/SKILL.md` — API security skill
- `skills/code-review-security/SKILL.md` — code review security skill
- `skills/secrets-scan/SKILL.md` — secrets scanning skill
- `skills/sca-audit/SKILL.md` — SCA dependency audit skill
